<!--
  Notification small icon.

  Must be a plain white-on-transparent shape: Android draws it as a silhouette
  and tints it. Handing setSmallIcon() the launcher icon — which is an
  <adaptive-icon>, not a drawable it can flatten — is not supported and misbehaves.
-->
